    "created_at": "2019-07-23T14:17:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-07-23T14:17:35Z",
    "body": "I think authors would prefer the simpler model of a single `Document` type with aliases. I know I was very confused by this mess in my web author days.\r\n\r\nThat said, I can easily be persuaded that at this point, the benefit to authors is small enough, that we should weigh implementers higher than authors/specifiers/theoretical purity.",
