    "body": "Only two days worth of data so far, so it's a bit preliminary, but <https://telemetry.mozilla.org/new-pipeline/dist.html#!cumulative=0&end_date=2019-07-25&include_spill=0&keys=__none__!__none__!__none__&max_channel_version=nightly%252F70&measure=USE_COUNTER2_HTMLDOCUMENTNAMEDGETTERHIT_PAGE&min_channel_version=null&processType=*&product=Firefox&sanitize=1&sort_by_value=0&sort_keys=submissions&start_date=2019-07-24&table=0&trim=1&use_submission_date=0> shows about 3% of pageloads returning something other than `undefined` from the named getter.",
